## 6. Recommendation process flow

```text
Student requests recommendations
              |
              v
Retrieve student profile
              |
              v
Retrieve available opportunities
              |
              v
Check mandatory eligibility
              |
              v
Calculate matching scores
              |
              v
Rank eligible opportunities
              |
              v
Display ranked results and explanations
```

The initial design specifically identifies the skill-match calculation:

```text
Skill Match =
    Number of matched required skills
    ---------------------------------
       Total number of required skills
```

Relevant completed courses and previous projects/experience are also proposed matching factors.

